<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Default Images | Admin</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #070b1d; color: #fff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    main { width: min(92%, 760px); }
    .back { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .card { padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid #303a65; border-radius: 1rem; background: #101425; }
    img { display: block; width: 120px; height: 150px; object-fit: cover; margin: .8rem 0; border-radius: .6rem; background: #1c2442; }
    .profile-preview { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; }
    input, button { margin-top: .7rem; max-width: 100%; }
    button { border: 0; border-radius: .5rem; padding: .6rem .8rem; color: #fff; background: #5865f2; cursor: pointer; }
    .message { color: #8ef3a5; min-height: 1.2rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <a class="back" href="/admin/home">← Admin dashboard</a>
    <h1>Default Images</h1>
    <p>These images are shared fallbacks across Readora. Uploading a new PNG replaces the existing default immediately.</p>
    <p class="message">{{message}}</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Default profile picture</h2>
        <img class="profile-preview" src="/images/default-profile.png" alt="Current default profile">
        <form action="/admin/default-images/profile" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
          <input type="file" name="image" accept=".png,image/png" required>
          <button type="submit">Update profile default</button>
        </form>
      </section>
      <section class="card">
        <h2>Default novel cover</h2>
        <img src="/images/novel-images/novel_dummy.png" alt="Current default novel cover">
        <form action="/admin/default-images/cover" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
          <input type="file" name="image" accept=".png,image/png" required>
          <button type="submit">Update cover default</button>
        </form>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
